   "en": "DATA",
   "title": "你需要准备什么",
   "html": "<p>本地演示无需接入现场。下面的数据清单用于说明这一业务的资料要求，不表示项目已取得这些实测资料。</p><p>标签来自<strong>人工拾取成果</strong>——过去几十年处理员点下的每一个初至点都是现成样本，只需要把「拾取位置 ±1 采样」标为正样本。关键纪律是<strong>按信噪比分层抽样</strong>：只挑好拾的道做标签，模型恰好会在你最需要的地方失灵。</p><div class='checklist'><div class='cl-head'><span>数据准备清单 · 3 项</span><span class='cl-prog'><span id='cl-txt'>0 / 3</span><span class='cl-bar'><i id='cl-fill'></i></span></span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='0'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>炮集原始记录</span><span class='cl-s'>单工区 10 万—100 万道，含道头与采样率</span></span><span class='cl-n'>人工拾取 5%—10% 的道作标签</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='1'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>近地表高程与速度</span><span class='cl-s'>炮点、检波点坐标，低降速带厚度</span></span><span class='cl-n'>无需标注，用于走时合理性质检</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='2'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>低信噪比道样本</span><span class='cl-s'>按信噪比分档建库</span></span><span class='cl-n'>重点标注，防止标签偏向好道</span></div></div>"
